// Cloudflare deployment (docs/decisiones.md 2026-10-19; tasks/plans/path-routing.md):
// the app lives at https://seequant.app/syndrome/, one Worker per SEEQuant app
// bound to a route of the brand domain. `npm run deploy` = `npm run build`
// (which leaves dist/ = syndrome/ + _headers, tools/deploy/stage.ts) +
// `wrangler deploy`.
//
// Static assets are served first, from dist/ by full path (dist/syndrome/… is
// /syndrome/…): no Worker strips a prefix, and dist/_headers applies to them.
// Only what has no asset reaches edge/worker.ts: the legacy host (a 301 to the
// new location, and a /sw.js that retires the old service worker), /syndrome
// and every language directory without its slash, /syndrome/es
// (`run_worker_first`, exact paths: no `*`; without it the asset server would
// answer /syndrome/es with its own non-301 trailing-slash redirect,
// tasks/plans/syndrome-es-url.md D8, H1), and missing paths (404). `not_found_handling: "none"`:
// with "single-page-application" a navigation without an asset would be
// answered with index.html before the Worker ever ran.
//
// Routes (the zone seequant.app is in the same account; a route needs the token
// permission "Workers Routes: Edit" on that zone). The rest of seequant.app,
// the root included, is the brand site's Worker (seequant.app/*, another repo):
// the most specific pattern wins, so these routes must never take more than
// the app's own paths (docs/decisiones.md 2026-10-20):
//   - seequant.app/syndrome*  the app (also matches /syndrome and /syndromeX,
//                             which the Worker redirects or answers 404);
//   - syndrome.seequant.app   the old origin (custom domain), kept so that
//                             links shared before the move keep working.
//
// First deploy in two phases: `npm run deploy -- --var LEGACY_STATUS:302`
// (the old origin answers temporary redirects only, its service worker is left
// alone) until the new location is measured; then `npm run deploy` (301 and the
// retiring service worker).
{
  "$schema": "node_modules/wrangler/config-schema.json",
  "name": "syndrome",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-10-01",
  "main": "edge/worker.ts",
  "assets": {
    "directory": "./dist",
    "not_found_handling": "none",
    "run_worker_first": ["/syndrome", "/syndrome/es"],
  },
  "workers_dev": true,
  "preview_urls": true,
  "routes": [
    { "pattern": "seequant.app/syndrome*", "zone_name": "seequant.app" },
    { "pattern": "syndrome.seequant.app", "custom_domain": true },
  ],
}
